				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Extract Command DTOs and service into file-per-struct modules\n\nDecompose the Command RPC module to align with the project-wide PascalCase file-per-struct convention. Create dedicated `Command.rs`, `CommandService.rs`, and `CommandValidation.rs` files within `Source/RPC/Commands`.\n\nThe `Command` struct defines the core DTO for command metadata (id, title, description) and implements `Serialize` and `Deserialize` for Tauri event payloads. `CommandService` establishes a placeholder in-memory registry using `HashMap` to track registered command handlers. `CommandValidation` provides the initial stub for input validation logic.\n\nEach file defines its core type as `Struct` to satisfy Tauri's `generate_handler!` macro symbol resolution requirements, maintaining architectural consistency with recent refactors in Echo, Telemetry, and Configuration modules.",
			"SHA": "0c75e06733f49b2421aff02e083ac4d8a1f3c70a"
		}
